1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:04,020
Astronomers detected a radio signal pulsing every twenty-two minutes.

2
00:00:04,060 --> 00:00:07,050
It has been repeating non-stop since 1988.

3
00:00:07,100 --> 00:00:10,490
Known pulsars spin rapidly, flashing every few seconds.

4
00:00:10,530 --> 00:00:14,300
According to physics, slowing down to twenty-two minutes kills the beam.

5
00:00:15,110 --> 00:00:19,180
Pause and guess. What could power an impossible signal for decades?

6
00:00:19,690 --> 00:00:24,680
It is target GPM J1839-10, an ultra-long period magnetar.

7
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:28,230
Its magnetic field is so powerful it breaks every existing pulsar model.

8
00:00:28,470 --> 00:00:32,610
Scientists hid thirty-five years of data because nobody could explain it.

